OL,3,GNEWSAHeat network project being        
OL,4,Aexplored by council                    
OL,6,FThe heat network would see heat        
OL,7,Fdistributed from large buildings, like 
OL,8,Fthe council's offices, the Royal       
OL,9,FBerkshire Hospital and schools, and    
OL,10,Ftransferred to nearby properties.      
